     "en": "The linesmen stand at the corner points of the side-lines opposite the referee. They help the referee supervise the match and indicate when a ball touches the ground outside the boundary lines through raising a flag or arm as well as pointing down (at the line) if the ball touches the boundary line or inside the court."
